-- title:
--   Kernel of a chartwise q-th power map is finite flat of rank q
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime, $T$ a commutative ring of characteristic $q$, and $W$ a Weierstrass curve over $T$; write $E$ for the Proj of the graded quotient ring attached to `W.toProjective` and $E'$ for the corresponding Proj attached to `(W.map (frobenius T q)).toProjective`. Let $\Phi : E \to E'$ be a morphism of schemes such that $\Phi$ followed by the structure morphism `projModelStrCR` of $E'$ to $\operatorname{Spec} T$ is the structure morphism of $E$. Assume: (hZ) there is a ring homomorphism $\psi$ from the degree-zero homogeneous localisation away from the coordinate $Z$ for the twisted curve to that for $W$ with $\psi(X/Z) = (X/Z)^q$ and $\psi(Y/Z) = (Y/Z)^q$, such that the $Z$-chart immersion of $E$ followed by $\Phi$ equals $\operatorname{Spec}\psi$ followed by the $Z$-chart immersion of $E'$; (hY) the analogous statement for the charts away from $Y$, with $X/Y \mapsto (X/Y)^q$ and $Z/Y \mapsto (Z/Y)^q$; (halg) there is a ring isomorphism $e$ from `OriginChartRing W.toProjective` modulo the ideal generated by $(X/Y)^q$ and $(Z/Y)^q$ onto $T[X]/(X^q)$ which carries the classes of the degree-zero elements coming from $T$ to their images under the structure map and the class of $X/Y$ to the image of $X$. Then the second projection from the fibre product of $\Phi$ with the underlying morphism of the zero section `kwZeroSect T (W.map (frobenius T q))` is finite, flat and locally of finite presentation, and its rank at every point $s$ of $\operatorname{Spec} T$ equals $q$.
--
--   This is the scheme-theoretic half of the computation of the kernel of the relative Frobenius on a Weierstrass model: granted that the morphism is the $q$-th power map on both standard charts and granted the algebra identification of the origin chart modulo $q$-th powers with $T[X]/(X^q)$, the kernel is a finite flat group-scheme-like object of constant rank $q$. It is used by [`WeierstrassCurve.DrinfeldGlobal.isFinite_pullback_snd_kwZeroSect_flat_finrank_eq_of_zChart_pow_originChart_pow`](thm.html#WeierstrassCurve.DrinfeldGlobal.isFinite_pullback_snd_kwZeroSect_flat_finrank_eq_of_zChart_pow_originChart_pow), where the algebra hypothesis is discharged.
